        <skos:broadMatch rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E7_Activity"/>
        <skos:definition>Ritual or administrative event that formally ends a Living Goddess tenure, marking the person&apos;s return to secular status. Common triggers include first menstruation, injury causing blood loss, or serious illness. This event terminates the divine embodiment and restores the girl to ordinary status.</skos:definition>
